; live context occupancy; a persistent cross-session Lifetime Ledger; per-provider/model totals, hourly trends and 7/30-day views; dark/light theme switching; optional cost estimates (off by default) with a visual price editor…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/awesome-dsh-plugin/awesome-dsh-plugin/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"antonio-mastropaolo/dsh-anthropic-membership - Sign in to DeepSeek Harness with a Claude Pro/Max membership (no API key), downscale Anthropic request images to a 2000px long edge, slim /compact summarizer payloads, and show 5-hour/weekly plan usage plus DSH message counts.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/awesome-dsh-plugin/awesome-dsh-plugin/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"5417f253172eb676b5d0271b974e41f8ff41eb8fea914dc3e7989d08e5f3ede9","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/awesome-dsh-plugin/awesome-dsh-plugin/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T08:25:42.458Z"},"agentContextAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T22:15:00.708Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/awesome-dsh-plugin/awesome-dsh-plugin/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T22:15:03.872Z","hash":"5417f253172eb676b5d0271b974e41f8ff41eb8fea914dc3e7989d08e5f3ede9","originalBytes":1348395,"storedBytes":1348395,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["dsh","deepseek","web","harness","session","model","agent","plugin","settings","tool","tools","plus","local","search","one","memory","panel","through","workspace","sessions","via","every","api","code","sidebar","live","file","conversation","image","mcp","composer","skill","each","usage","when","context","native","token","adds","skills","chat","provider","official","browser","over","turn","page","own","one-click","task","desktop","windows","gui","text","status","review","git","read","files","optional","list","any","prompt","models","balance","user","card","approval","markdown","without","per","run","plugins","real","agents","before","message","across","key","projec